00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:06,000
Commando is a action, adventure, thriller film directed by Mark L. Lester.

3
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:36,000
John Matrix, the former leader of a special commando strike force that always got the toughest
jobs done, is forced back into action when his young daughter is kidnapped.

4
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:06,000
To find her, Matrix has to fight his way through an array of punks, killers,
one of his former commandos, and a fully equipped private army.

5
00:22:30,000 --> 00:22:36,000
With the help of a feisty stewardess and an old friend, Matrix has only a few hours to
overcome his greatest challenge: finding his daughter before she's killed.

6
00:27:00,000 --> 00:27:06,000
John Matrix, played by Arnold Schwarzenegger.

