Commando is a 1985 American action film directed by Mark L.

13
00:58:30,000 --> 00:58:36,000
Lester and produced by Joel Silver.

14
01:03:00,000 --> 01:03:06,000
It stars Arnold Schwarzenegger in the lead role, alongside Rae Dawn
Chong, Alyssa Milano, Vernon Wells, Bill Duke and Dan Hedaya.

15
01:07:30,000 --> 01:07:36,000
The musical score was composed by James Horner.

16
01:12:00,000 --> 01:12:06,000
Commando was released in the United States on October 4, 1985, where
it received praise for the action sequences and humor.

17
01:16:30,000 --> 01:16:36,000
The film became a commercial success at the box office and was nominated for a
Saturn Award for Best Special Effects, but lost to Back to the Future.

18
01:21:00,000 --> 01:21:06,000
The film explores themes of daughter, fight, kidnapping, mercenary, lone wolf.

